> ### Name: fit_loo
> ### Title: Leave-one-out cross-validation for a fit
> ### Aliases: fit_loo loo.CmdStanMCMC loo.stanfit
> ### Keywords: internal
> 
> ### ** Examples
> 
> ## Not run: 
> ##D fit1 <- lmm_animal(Y, X, A)
> ##D fit2 <- lmm_animal(Y, X, A, genetic_structure = "factor", n_factors = 2)
> ##D loo::loo_compare(fit_loo(fit1), fit_loo(fit2))
